"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が落ち込むわけないじゃないか(*^o^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに応援してくれる人が居て、\n本当に、幸せです(> <)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のポジションにも誇りを持っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと頑張ろうって、また楽しみも一つ増えたし、(*^^*)！\n嬉しいことじゃないかっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの言葉で、また沢山のことを感じ、学びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、成長していくんですね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に登れちゃったらつまらない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽して登った坂よりも、苦労して登った坂の方が\n絶対、素敵なはずっ！     だよね＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/9170261/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつでも、私と、一緒に歩いてくれますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/9170261/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/9170261/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが、私の力になってくれるように\n私も皆さんの力になれますように。 ***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/9170261/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前の一枚ッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさゆにゃん。(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、台風すごかったけど大丈夫でしたか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/9170261/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  いつも ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"       さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2993":{"blocks":[{"t